- ✅ [ContactsDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ContactsDetail.tsx) (20.9KB)
- ✅ [AccountsDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AccountsDetail.tsx) (21.8KB)
- ✅ [OpportunitiesDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OpportunitiesDetail.tsx) (23.2KB)
- ✅ [QuotesDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/QuotesDetail.tsx) (19.8KB) / [QuoteBuilder.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/QuoteBuilder.tsx)
- ✅ [SalesPipeline.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SalesPipeline.tsx) / [ForecastDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ForecastDashboard.tsx) (7.8KB)
- ✅ [LeadScoringDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeadScoringDashboard.tsx) (8.5KB) / [LeadScoringAnalytics.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeadScoringAnalytics.tsx)
- ✅ [SalesCommissionManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SalesCommissionManagement.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Territory Management Setup (Rule Builder)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle lets admins define territory rules: "Zip Code IN (90210, 90211) AND Industry = Technology → Assign to John Doe." Missing rule configurator and auto-assignment engine. |
| **Sales Quota Management** | ⚠️ Partial | Commission management exists. Missing: A quota distribution UI where sales managers break down annual targets to rep level by month/quarter with approval. |
| **Collaborative Forecasting (Rollup)** | ⚠️ Partial | ForecastDashboard.tsx exists. Missing: Rep submits a commit → Manager adjusts rollup → VP sees consolidated pipeline call. |
| **Activity Management (Full Oracle)** | ⚠️ Partial | [SalesActivities.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/SalesActivities.tsx) exists. Missing: Oracle's rich task/call/meeting logging with contact linkage and follow-up reminder engine. |
| **Adaptive Intelligence (AI Scoring)** | ⚠️ Partial | LeadScoring pages exist. Missing: Oracle AI's predictive model that uses historical win rates by industry/size/region to produce an Next Best Action recommendation. |
| **Partner Relationship Management (PRM)** | ✅ `partner/` schema exists. [PartnersPage.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PartnersPage.tsx) exists (21KB). Relatively strong. |
| **Mobile Sales App** | ⚠️ Partial | [MobileApps.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MobileApps.tsx) exists generically. Missing: Dedicated offline-capable CRM mobile UI with voice-to-text note capture. |

