## Module 28 — CRM Marketing (Oracle Eloqua / CX Marketing)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle CX Marketing (Eloqua)

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [CampaignsDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CampaignsDashboard.tsx) (5.5KB) / [CampaignsDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CampaignsDetail.tsx) (15KB — very large)
- ✅ [Marketing.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Marketing.tsx) (6.3KB) / [MarketingEngagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/MarketingEngagement.tsx) (7.2KB)
- ✅ [LeadConversion.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/LeadConversion.tsx) — Lead conversion tracking

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Visual Campaign Flow Builder (Node Canvas)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle Eloqua uses a drag-and-drop canvas with conditional nodes (Send Email → IF Opened → Wait 3 Days → Send SMS ELSE → Re-queue). |
| **Email Template Builder (WYSIWYG)** | ❌ Missing | Visual HTML email builder with dynamic merge fields and preview by device. |
| **Mass Email Blast Engine** | ❌ Missing | Sending thousands of personalized emails via a queued delivery engine (SMTP/SendGrid). |
| **Marketing Attribution Model** | ❌ Missing | First-touch, last-touch, or multi-touch attribution assigning credit for each Won Opportunity to the campaigns that influenced it. |
| **UTM Tracking / Web Beacons** | ❌ Missing | Tracking email open rates (pixel), click rates, and landing page visits with UTM parameters. |
| **Segment Builder (Dynamic Lists)** | ⚠️ Partial | Campaign members exist. Missing: Rule-based dynamic segment (e.g., "All Contacts with Industry = Finance AND Last Activity > 90 Days"). |
| **A/B Testing Framework** | ❌ Missing | Split-testing email subject lines or content and measuring statistical significance of opens/clicks. |

