## Module 29 — CPQ (Configure, Price, Quote)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle CPQ Cloud (Big Machines)

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [QuotesDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/QuotesDetail.tsx) (19.8KB) — Very rich quote UI
- ✅ [QuoteBuilder.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/QuoteBuilder.tsx) (4.3KB)
- ✅ [QuotesAndOrders.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/QuotesAndOrders.tsx) (6.5KB)
- ✅ [ProductsDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ProductsDetail.tsx) (19.6KB)
- ✅ [PricingRebatesEngine.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PricingRebatesEngine.tsx) (6.6KB)
- ✅ [PricingPromotionManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/PricingPromotionManagement.tsx) (6.3KB)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Product Configurator (Inclusion/Exclusion Rules)** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | Oracle CPQ has a rule engine: "If Server = Dell PowerEdge THEN require PDU ELSE exclude 110V Power Supply." No rules-engine exists in Nexus. |
| **Advanced Pricing (Qualifiers + Modifiers)** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | Oracle Advanced Pricing: Qualifiers determine who is eligible. Modifiers calculate the discount. Multi-dimensional pricing matrices. |
| **Quote Guided Selling** | ❌ Missing | Oracle guides a sales rep through a structured questionnaire to automatically filter and recommend products based on customer requirements. |
| **Margin Analysis (Deal Desk)** | ⚠️ Partial | Some pricing analysis exists. Missing: Real-time margin calculator with cost roll-up, floor price warnings, approval triggers when margin < threshold. |
| **Contract Terms Library (CLM)** | ❌ Missing | Oracle CPQ integrates with Contract Lifecycle Management (CLM) to auto-include standard terms or flag deviations. |
| **E-Signature Integration** | ❌ Missing | DocuSign/Adobe Sign integration to route finalized quotes for electronic signature and auto-create an order upon signature. |
| **Quote Approval Workflow** | ⚠️ Partial | Approval concept exists. Missing: Multi-level approval based on discount %, deal size, or margin floor violations. |

