## Module 30 — CRM Service Cloud (Case Management)
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle Service Cloud / B2C Service

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [Service.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Service.tsx) (5.4KB)
- ✅ [CasesDetail.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/CasesDetail.tsx) (11.8KB) — Rich case view
- ✅ [ServiceRequestPortal.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ServiceRequestPortal.tsx) (9.9KB) / [ServiceRequestQueue.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ServiceRequestQueue.tsx)
- ✅ [KnowledgeManagement.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/KnowledgeManagement.tsx) (7.5KB)
- ✅ [TicketDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/TicketDashboard.tsx)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Omnichannel Routing Engine** | ❌ Missing | Oracle routes inbound cases to the most skilled available agent based on skills, language, and queue priority. Nexus manual-assigns. |
| **Email-to-Case Ingestion** | ❌ Missing | Customer emails a support address → Oracle auto-creates a case, extracts sentiment, and routes to queue. |
| **SLA Milestones & Escalation Timers** | ⚠️ Partial | SLA tracking page exists. Missing: The real-time countdown timer per case and automatic escalation action (assign supervisor, send alert) when SLA is breached. |
| **Agent Scripting** | ❌ Missing | Step-by-step dynamic scripts guiding agents through troubleshooting for specific product issues. |
| **Customer Survey / CSAT** | ❌ Missing | Post-case resolution survey trigger (email/SMS). CSAT score rolled up to agent scorecards. |
| **Contact Center Analytics (Supervisor Dashboard)** | ❌ Missing | Real-time view: active queue depth, average handle time, CSAT by agent, escalation count. |
| **Knowledge Management (AI-Search)** | ⚠️ Partial | KnowledgeManagement.tsx exists. Missing: AI-powered search that recommends relevant KB articles when an agent types the case description. |

