### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Commission Plan Builder** | ⚠️ Partial | Plans exist. Missing: Multi-tier accelerator logic (0–100% quota = 5% rate, 100–120% = 8% rate, 120%+ = 12% rate with rollover). |
| **Clawback Rules** | ❌ Missing | Oracle tracks commissions paid on deals that are subsequently cancelled or refunded, and deducts from future periods. |
| **Dispute Management** | ❌ Missing | Reps can dispute calculated commissions; Oracle provides a structured exception/dispute form and audit trail. |
| **Gamification Dashboard (Rep Earnings Leaderboard)** | ⚠️ Partial | [gamification.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/gamification.ts) schema exists. Missing: Real-time leaderboard showing rank, YTD earnings, accelerator tier status. |
| **Plan Agreement (Digital Sign-Off)** | ❌ Missing | Reps digitally acknowledge their compensation plan. Tracked by Oracle for compliance. |

