## Module 33 — EPM: Financial Planning & Analysis
**Oracle Equivalent:** Oracle EPM Planning Essbase

### NexusAI Pages Currently Existing
- ✅ [EPMPage.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/EPMPage.tsx) (9KB) — Main EPM page
- ✅ `epm/` sub-directory — **11 pages**
- ✅ [BudgetPlanning.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BudgetPlanning.tsx) (7.6KB) / [BudgetingDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/BudgetingDashboard.tsx)
- ✅ [ForecastDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/ForecastDashboard.tsx) (7.8KB)
- ✅ Schema: [epm.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/epm.ts) — Scenarios, Versions, Dimensions, Units, Drivers, ESG metrics

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Grid (Spreadsheet-Style Budget Entry)** | ⚠️ Partial | Some budget entry exists. Missing: Oracle's Excel-like grid with frozen row/column headers, inline cell editing across multiple dimensions simultaneously. |
| **Smart View (Excel Add-In)** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | Bi-directional Excel integration. CFOs and FP&A teams insist on Excel. Oracle's Smart View lets them load/refresh/submit budget data from Excel directly. |
| **Essbase Calculation Engine** | ❌ **CRITICAL** | In-memory OLAP engine that aggregates plan_units across hierarchies instantly. Missing: the calc scripts and in-memory aggregation worker. |
| **Scenario Comparison Dashboard** | ⚠️ Partial | Scenarios exist. Missing: Side-by-side variance comparison (Budget vs. Forecast vs. Actual) across dimensions. |
| **Driver-Based Forecasting** | ⚠️ Partial | `planDrivers` schema exists. Missing: The execution engine that applies a driver (e.g., headcount × average salary) to auto-populate related plan_units. |
| **Workflow Approval for Budget Submission** | ❌ Missing | Oracle routes budget enter/submit/approve across an ownership hierarchy. |

